
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>霧雨巡録社</title>
    
    <!-- Google Fonts: Shippori Mincho -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Shippori+Mincho:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-overlay: rgba(10, 12, 15, 0.45);
            --card-bg: rgba(10, 12, 20, 0.40);
            --text-color: #f1f5f9;
            --accent-red: #ef4444;
            --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Shippori Mincho', "Yu Mincho", "游明朝", "Hiragino Mincho ProN", serif;
            color: var(--text-color);
            background-color: #111;
            /* 紅葉と瓦屋根の写真 */
            background-image: linear-gradient(var(--bg-overlay), var(--bg-overlay)), url('IMG_2780.jpg');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-attachment: fixed;
            line-height: 2.0;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        a {
            color: var(--text-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        /* 左右の縦書きフレーム風装飾 */
        .side-text {
            position: fixed;
            top: 15%;
            writing-mode: vertical-rl;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            color: var(--accent-red);
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            opacity: 0.85;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 1;
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(185, 28, 28, 0.7);
        }
        .side-text.left { left: 3%; }
        .side-text.right { right: 3%; }

        /* コンテナ */
        .container {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        /* ファーストビュー */
        .hero {
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .site-logo {
            max-width: 80%;
            width: 460px;
            height: auto;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.9));
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero-sub {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            letter-spacing: 0.25em;
            font-family: sans-serif;
            text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
        }

        .scroll-down {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 35px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.25em;
            color: #aaa;
            font-family: sans-serif;
            animation: fadeInOut 2.5s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes fadeInOut {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { opacity: 0.9; transform: translateY(8px); }
        }

        /* スクロール後の紹介文 */
        .intro-section {
            padding: 80px 0 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .catch-phrase {
            font-size: 1.6em;
            letter-spacing: 0.25em;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .intro-box {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            padding: 30px 25px;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            line-height: 2.1;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        /* 単一のメイン導線ボタン */
        .nav-section {
            padding: 40px 0 100px;
        }

        .main-entrance-card {
            display: block;
            background: rgba(10, 12, 20, 0.35);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 28px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }

        .main-entrance-card:hover {
            background: rgba(25, 12, 18, 0.55);
            border-color: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.6);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .entrance-title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
        }

        .entrance-title span {
            color: var(--accent-red);
            margin-left: 8px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }

        .entrance-desc {
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 0;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            font-family: sans-serif;
            text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .side-text { display: none; }
            .catch-phrase { font-size: 1.3em; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="side-text left">世の空の下に消える世の歪み</div>
    <div class="side-text right">幽玄な大地は砂状の楼閣と化し</div>

    <div class="container">

        <!-- ① トップロゴ表示 -->
        <div class="hero">
            <img src="無題36_20260909200217.png" alt="霧雨巡録社" class="site-logo">
            <p class="hero-sub">Together with the Drizzle</p>
            <div class="scroll-down">SCROLL</div>
        </div>

        <!-- ② スクロール後の文言 -->
        <div class="intro-section">
            <h2 class="catch-phrase">怪異と萌えの霧雨巡録社</h2>
            <div class="intro-box">
                <p>
                    同人サークル「霧雨巡録社」および暮葉畏啓の制作物・活動拠点をまとめたポータルページです。<br>
                    小説、制作物、各種SNS等の各コンテンツへは以下よりお入りください。
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ③ main.html（活動場所ページ）への1本化した導線 -->
        <div class="nav-section">
            <a href="main.html" class="main-entrance-card">
                <div class="entrance-title">
                    各種活動場所へ <span>→</span>
                </div>
                <div class="entrance-desc">
                    小説家になろう / 個人サイト / note / pixiv / SNS 等
                </div>
            </a>
        </div>

        <footer>
            <p>&copy; Together with the Drizzle</p>
        </footer>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
